box fts scft
Dim 2
grid 125 63
boxLengths 20.0 10.0
species A
species B
species C
Nr 5
C 1

# molecule keyword, molecule type, vol fraction number of blocks, block N, block type, block N, block type...
molecule linear phi 0.5 1 10 A smear Gaussian 0.15
molecule linear phi 0.5 1 10 B smear Gaussian 0.15
molecule wall C planar dir 0 xi 0.1 width 2.0

# potential keyword, style Helfand, kappa*Nr, time step
potential Helfand 50.0 0.1 modify zeromean updateScheme EMPC

# potential keyword, style Flory, type I, type J, chi*Nr, delt+, delt-
potential Flory A B 2.9 0.1 0.01 initialize random 0.2 0.0 updateScheme EMPC

potential wall A C 1.0 xrange 0.0 2.5

logFreq 250
chemFieldFreq 1000
densityFieldFreq 250

endBox

run nvt 3000
